0..67 Comment "// A Tarski universe closed under pairs, dependent pairs and paths."
68..70 Comment "//"
71..149 Comment "// Martin-Löf\'s universe is closed under dependent functions, dependent pairs"
150..225 Comment "// and identity types. Each such code decodes to a family at the decodes of"
226..302 Comment "// its fields. A decode thus stands as a family\'s argument, a call in place."
303..338 Comment "// The call is the type it returns."
339..341 Comment "//"
342..418 Comment "// Each code is its own block. The pair code decodes to the pairs of its two"
419..490 Comment "// decodes. The dependent pair code decodes to the pairs over its first"
491..561 Comment "// decode. Its second field is a family of codes over that decode. The"
562..638 Comment "// decoder\'s binder takes the same decode, so the two convert. The path code"
639..706 Comment "// decodes to the paths between two values of its carrier\'s decode."
707..709 Comment "//"
710..787 Comment "// - see: `pathological/universe/pair-and-path-codes.gandr` — a run for the"
788..814 Comment "//   first decode, refused"
815..885 Comment "// - see: `model/universe/inductive-recursive.gandr` — the dependent"
886..910 Comment "//   functions, admitted"
911..981 Comment "// - see: Martin-Löf, _Intuitionistic Type Theory_, Bibliopolis, 1984"
983..999 Comment "// The naturals."
